cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the paper it accompanies and the
  Cerpa et al. (2022) model archive it analyses.
title: >-
  trench_pull_fluidity: force-balance analysis of the Cerpa et al. Fluidity
  subduction models
abstract: >-
  Post-processing code that measures the vertically integrated horizontal force
  balance of two free-subduction models directly from the vertical normal
  stress, partitioning the plate-wide driving force into trench pull, ridge push
  and the tilting force. Contains no model code; the model output it analyses is
  published separately by Cerpa et al. (2022).
type: software
